OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI am now the boss of my pain - it
OL,4,Ano longer controls me
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalkden was speaking after a new study
OL,7,Frevealed that people in the most
OL,8,Fdeprived socio-economic areas of
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland are at higher risk of
OL,10,Fchronic pain and three times more
OL,11,Flikely to face pain-related depression.
